{"page":502,"verses":[{"verse_key":"45:33","surah":45,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَبَدَا لَهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتُ مَا عَمِلُوا۟ وَحَاقَ بِهِم مَّا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The evil of their actions will [then] become clear to them. The punishment they mocked will engulf them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَبَدَا","en_gloss":"And (will) appear","transliteration":"wabadā","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتُ","en_gloss":"(the) evil","transliteration":"sayyiātu","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَحَاقَ","en_gloss":"and (will) envelop","transliteration":"waḥāqa","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِم","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"[at it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_gloss":"(to) mock","transliteration":"yastahziūna","verse_key":"45:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:33"}]},{"verse_key":"45:34","surah":45,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَقِيلَ ٱلْيَوْمَ نَنسَىٰكُمْ كَمَا نَسِيتُمْ لِقَآءَ يَوْمِكُمْ هَـٰذَا وَمَأْوَىٰكُمُ ٱلنَّارُ وَمَا لَكُم مِّن نَّـٰصِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It will be said, ‘Today We shall ignore you just as you ignored your appointment with this Day. The Fire will be your home and no one will help you,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقِيلَ","en_gloss":"And it will be said","transliteration":"waqīla","verse_key":"45:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"Today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_